00:16:04,580 --> 00:16:07,750
There's no way you're doing this wedding now, okay?

252
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:11,590
What? That's not fair. It's not my fault.

253
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,380
I was with my bridesmaid.

254
00:16:13,590 --> 00:16:15,680
And who's to say I would've said yes?

255
00:16:15,890 --> 00:16:18,050
I mean, I would've said yes.

256
00:16:19,430 --> 00:16:22,350
Look, you are making way too big a deal out of this.

257
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,230
Everything worked out okay.

258
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:25,810
It's just weird, okay?

259
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:30,020
I don't want to be saying my vows with the mental image of you and Monica.

260
00:16:30,190 --> 00:16:33,440
I need... I don't know what I need. I need a walk.

261
00:16:33,610 --> 00:16:37,160
- Wait, Chandler, it's not a big deal.     - It is to me.

262
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:40,660
You wanted to sleep with Batman and settled for Robin.

263
00:16:45,170 --> 00:16:48,710
- This is crazy.     - No, Robin is so gay.

264
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:55,470
- So now what have we agreed?     - No more pranks.

265
00:16:55,630 --> 00:16:59,260
- What else?     - You and Daddy were not on a break.

266
00:16:59,430 --> 00:17:00,560
Very good.

267
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:07,060
Rachel, what are you doing here?

268
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:10,480
I'm just visiting my good friend Carol.

269
00:17:10,650 --> 00:17:13,400
- Your good friend?     - Yeah.

270
00:17:13,570 --> 00:17:15,240
What's her last name?

271
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:19,120
Carol...

272
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:21,450
...Lesbian.     - Nice.

273
00:17:24,660 --> 00:17:27,670
By the way, that, uh... That line down my face...

274
00:17:28,210 --> 00:17:34,130
The line that prompted a student in my last class of the day to say:

275
00:17:34,300 --> 00:17:36,260
"Dude, don't you ever wash your face?"

276
00:17:38,430 --> 00:17:40,510
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

277
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:43,890
I don't want you teaching my son that stuff anymore.

278
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:45,930
- Okay?     - Fine. Fine.

279
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:49,850
Once I taught him that stuff, he called me "fun Aunt Rachel."

280
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:52,110
And I loved being fun Aunt Rachel.

281
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,740
I'm glad you guys were bonding but...

282
00:17:56,950 --> 00:17:59,070
Look, he doesn't have any siblings.

283
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:01,620
Somebody has to teach him this stuff.

284
00:18:01,870 --> 00:18:05,620
I haven't taught him anything a normal 6-year-old doesn't know.

285
00:18:05,870 --> 00:18:07,910
- Crap!     - I gotta go.

286
00:18:14,090 --> 00:18:15,960
- Hey.     - Hey.

287
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:20,800
You want this scone? It came for me but it would rather sleep with you.

288
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,850
Nothing even happened.

289
00:18:25,310 --> 00:18:27,680
I just... I don't want you to be upset.

290
00:18:27,850 --> 00:18:29,640
How can I not be upset?

291
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:32,980
I finally fall in love with this fantastic woman...

292
00:18:33,230 --> 00:18:35,480
...and it turns out she wanted you first.

293
00:18:35,650 --> 00:18:38,570
Yeah, for like a half an hour one night.

294
00:18:39,070 --> 00:18:41,660
Chandler, she wants you for the rest of her life.

295
00:18:43,370 --> 00:18:47,200
We look at you and we see you together, and it just...

296
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:50,750
It fits, you know?

297
00:18:51,170 --> 00:18:54,590
And you just know it's gonna last forever.

298
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:59,510
That's what you should say.

299
00:19:01,050 --> 00:19:02,300
What?

300
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:07,180
When you're marrying us, that's what you should say.

301
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:10,980
Really? I could do it?

302
00:19:12,150 --> 00:19:13,480
I'd love you to do it.

303
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:16,020
Hey.

304
00:19:18,740 --> 00:19:22,950
But those are the words. Those exact words.

305
00:19:23,910 --> 00:19:26,410
Well, I don't remember exactly...

306
00:19:27,490 --> 00:19:33,170
...but it's pretty much about having and giving and sharing and receiving.

307
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:39,510
- Hey.     - Hey.

308
00:19:39,670 --> 00:19:42,760
- So you guys doing okay?     - Yeah.

309
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:47,010
We talked and Monica made me see that I overreacted a little bit.

310
00:19:47,180 --> 00:19:51,480
- Some things are more important.    - Yeah, baby.

311
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:57,480
I'm really glad you guys are okay, but I just keep thinking...

312
00:19:57,730 --> 00:20:00,900
...what would've happened if you two had hooked up.

313
00:20:03,990 --> 00:20:05,820
Honey, dinner's ready!

314
00:20:11,790 --> 00:20:14,250
What's my little chef got for me tonight?

315
00:20:14,420 --> 00:20:16,790
- Your favorite.     - Ho, ho, ho.

316
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,670
Fried stuff with cheese.

317
00:20:19,210 --> 00:20:20,250
Yep.

318
00:20:20,420 --> 00:20:21,960
And lots of it!

319
00:20:23,470 --> 00:20:24,840
Thanks, sweetheart.

320
00:20:25,260 --> 00:20:27,970
Give me a little sugar. Okay.

321
00:20:29,350 --> 00:20:30,470
You wanna go...?

322
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:32,980
Here we go, here we go, here we go.

323
00:20:37,110 --> 00:20:39,110
How you doing?

324
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:47,200
- Hey.     - Hey!

325
00:20:47,450 --> 00:20:52,080
I'm sorry to do this again, but could you look after Ben for a bit?

326
00:20:52,290 --> 00:20:53,960
I've got this meeting at school...

327
00:20:54,210 --> 00:20:57,080
...and he asked for his "fun Aunt Rachel."

328
00:20:57,710 --> 00:21:00,090
Well, of course I will watch him.

329
00:21:00,340 --> 00:21:02,300
We have fun, don't we, Ben?

330
00:21:03,590 --> 00:21:06,680
- Okay. See you later, pal.     - Okay.

331
00:21:05,890 --> 00:21:06,920

332
00:21:08,350 --> 00:21:10,970
Wait a minute. Ben, I can't do it.

333
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:13,850
- You got something on your back.      - What?

334
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:17,190
That's great. That is great.

335
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:19,810
What did we just finish talking about, Ben?

336
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:22,940
"What did we just finish talking about, Ben?"

337
00:21:23,650 --> 00:21:25,240
That's it! Come here!

338
00:21:25,490 --> 00:21:28,030
- You're in big trouble, young man!     - No, wait.

339
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:30,410
Ben, come here! I am not kidding!

340
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:31,910
You guys, hold it. Seriously...

341
00:21:33,370 --> 00:21:34,580
Oh, my God!

